          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The concept of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coherent+state"} coherent state
            in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+mechanics"} quantum mechanics
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+physics"} quantum physics
            may be formalized in the context of
            = succeed "," do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+quantization"} geometric quantization
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Rawnsley77"} Rawnsley 1977
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Kirwin07"} Kirwin 2007
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantization+of+Chern-Simons+theory"} quantization of Chern-Simons theory
          %h2#references References
          %p
            The original reference that interpreted coherent states in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+quantization"} geometric quantization
            over
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K%C3%A4hler+manifolds"} Kähler manifolds
          %ul
            %li#Rawnsley77
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+H.+Rawnsley"}> John H. Rawnsley
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Coherent states and Kähler manifolds
              %strong 2
              28 (1977) 403-415 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/qmath/28.4.403"}> doi:10.1093/qmath/28.4.403
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Review and further developments:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mauro+Spera"}> Mauro Spera
              ,
              %em On Kählerian coherent states
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.bio21.bas.bg/proceedings/Proceedings_files/vol1/GEOM19.DJVU"}> djvu
              )
          %p Generalization to non-Kähler symplectic manifolds is in
          %ul
            %li#Kirwin07
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Kirwin"}> William Kirwin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Coherent states in geometric quantization
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0502026"} arXiv:0502026
              %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2271203"} MR2008b:53114
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.geomphys.2006.04.007"} doi
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Anatol Odzijewicz,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Coherent state method in geometric quantization
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Coherent states and geometric quantization
                %strong 150
                (1992), no. 2, 385–413
                %a{:href => "http://ams.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/leavingmsn?url=http://projecteuclid.org/getRecord?id=euclid.cmp/1104251870"} doi
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1194023"} 94c:58077
            %li
              %p
                Brian Charles Hall,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Geometric quantization and the generalized Segal–Bargmann transform for Lie groups of compact type
                = succeed ":233\u2013268," do
                  %strong 226
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002200200607"} doi
            %li
              %p
                D. J. Rowe,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Coherent states, induced representations, geometric quantization, and their vector coherent state extensions
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 34
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2056987"} MR2005a:81100
            %li
              %p
                C. Florentino, P. Matias, J. Mourão, J. P. Nunes,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Geometric quantization, complex structures and the coherent state transform
                = succeed "(2):303\u2013322," do
                  %strong 221
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2124866"} MR2005m:53179
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jfa.2004.10.021"} doi
